WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.769
One order. Typed three times.

2
00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:05.291
On the invoice, 300 became 30.

3
00:00:05.342 --> 00:00:06.827
That is why month-end drags

4
00:00:06.827 --> 00:00:08.717
and the stock never matches.

5
00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:10.237
I'm an A.I. voice,

6
00:00:10.237 --> 00:00:12.062
speaking for Sayed Rashid.

7
00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:13.164
He helps Singapore

8
00:00:13.164 --> 00:00:15.001
businesses with 5 to 200 staff

9
00:00:15.001 --> 00:00:17.372
stop typing the same thing twice.

10
00:00:17.722 --> 00:00:19.124
Bring one process to a free

11
00:00:19.124 --> 00:00:20.183
20-minute call.

12
00:00:20.183 --> 00:00:21.363
An order, an invoice,

13
00:00:21.363 --> 00:00:22.668
or a stock count.

14
00:00:23.019 --> 00:00:24.405
You leave with three fixes,

15
00:00:24.405 --> 00:00:25.556
ranked by payoff.

16
00:00:25.556 --> 00:00:27.463
At least one needs no purchase.

17
00:00:27.914 --> 00:00:28.658
Why him?

18
00:00:28.658 --> 00:00:29.575
He is an ex-auditor

19
00:00:29.575 --> 00:00:30.443
who has cleaned up

20
00:00:30.443 --> 00:00:31.613
this mess before.

21
00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:32.742
1,200 open items,

22
00:00:32.742 --> 00:00:33.693
in books nobody

23
00:00:33.693 --> 00:00:35.404
had closed in twenty years,

24
00:00:35.404 --> 00:00:36.959
cleared at go-live.

25
00:00:37.008 --> 00:00:39.157
And 176,000 dollars of equipment

26
00:00:39.157 --> 00:00:40.902
that was in the warehouse,

27
00:00:40.902 --> 00:00:42.864
but not in the accounts.

28
00:00:42.914 --> 00:00:44.433
38 systems taken live,

29
00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:46.089
and 91% of those clients

30
00:00:46.089 --> 00:00:47.751
are still with him.

31
00:00:48.201 --> 00:00:49.001
It's free.

32
00:00:49.001 --> 00:00:50.148
Nothing to prepare.

33
00:00:50.148 --> 00:00:51.747
No pitch unless you ask.

34
00:00:52.098 --> 00:00:53.515
He takes every call himself,

35
00:00:53.515 --> 00:00:55.515
so there are only a few each week.

36
00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:57.379
Book your free 20 minutes below.
